# This repository is PUBLIC - it exists only to host the two legal pages that Play requires at a
# stable HTTPS URL. Everything else in this directory is internal working material and stays out:
#
#   STORE_LISTING.md   documents which medical claims the listing deliberately avoids, and why.
#                      Sound reasoning to keep; a poor thing to publish next to the app.
#   RELEASE_NOTES.md   includes the draft for the build that turns on Play Integrity. Announcing
#                      when an anti-abuse measure switches on is not useful to anyone but abusers.
#   DATA_SAFETY.md     internal notes naming code paths and files.
#   assets/            store icon and feature graphic; Play Console holds these, not a web page.
*.md
# ...with one exception, which explains what this repository is.
!README.md
assets/
